Butler: Hello. Welcome to your final meal.
Butler: You two will take turns eating steaks. {{ num_poison }} of these {{ total }} steaks are poisoned.
Butler: Each round, you may eat as many steaks as you want. However, you must eat at least one before ending the day.
Butler: Every time you eat a steak, you earn one point. At the start of your turn, you may use these points to purchase a powerup.
Butler: After one poisoned steak, you will feel a little woozy. After two, you will perish.
Butler: The game will continue until there is one survivor. Good luck!